{"parse":{"title":"天赋/专注射击","pageid":1858,"revid":5809,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B/%E4%B8%93%E6%B3%A8%E5%B0%84%E5%87%BB&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B/%E4%B8%93%E6%B3%A8%E5%B0%84%E5%87%BB&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B/%E4%B8%93%E6%B3%A8%E5%B0%84%E5%87%BB&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>专注射击</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E4.B8.93.E6.B3.A8.E5.B0.84.E5.87.BB\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"专注射击\"><b>专注射击</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"天赋 高地射手.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/1c/jv32ojwr5zaehcvug5fp27bmhjerap8.png/80px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B_%E9%AB%98%E5%9C%B0%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/1c/jv32ojwr5zaehcvug5fp27bmhjerap8.png/120px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B_%E9%AB%98%E5%9C%B0%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/1c/jv32ojwr5zaehcvug5fp27bmhjerap8.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />专注射击\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"天赋一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>行动开始时，若自身范围<font color=\"red\">2</font>格内没敌人，暴击率提高<font color=\"red\">15%</font>，物攻提高<font color=\"red\">5%</font>，持续<font color=\"red\">1</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%9B%E5%BC%93%E7%AE%AD%E6%89%8B\" title=\"角色图鉴库/王国军弓箭手\"><img alt=\"头像 王国军弓箭手.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/a0/auyfyz01uk57z23nmwfkeggf24cy4qz.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">王国军弓箭手</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"天赋二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>行动开始时，若自身范围<font color=\"red\">2</font>格内没敌人，暴击率提高<font color=\"red\">20%</font>，物攻提高<font color=\"red\">5%</font>，持续<font color=\"red\">1</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"天赋三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/5d/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/5d/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/5d/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>行动开始时，若自身范围<font color=\"red\">2</font>格内没敌人，暴击率提高<font color=\"red\">25%</font>，物攻提高<font color=\"red\">8%</font>，持续<font color=\"red\">1</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"天赋四星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/31/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/56px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/31/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/84px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/31/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/112px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>行动开始时，若自身范围<font color=\"red\">2</font>格内没敌人，暴击率提高<font color=\"red\">30%</font>，物攻提高<font color=\"red\">8%</font>，持续<font color=\"red\">1</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"天赋五星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/bf/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/56px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/bf/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/84px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/bf/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/112px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>行动开始时，若自身范围<font color=\"red\">2</font>格内没敌人，暴击率提高<font color=\"red\">35%</font>，物攻提高<font color=\"red\">12%</font>，持续<font color=\"red\">1</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022163627\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.156 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.286 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4699/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27877/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7245/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  258.088      1 模板:天赋\n100.00%  258.088      1 -total\n  4.42%   11.408      5 模板:中括号介绍化\n  3.27%    8.451      1 模板:面包屑\n  2.11%    5.455      1 模板:列表/头像\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:1858-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022163627 and revision id 5809. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</